cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Post-Quantum, Measured: the lab"
message: >-
  Runnable companion code for the book Post-Quantum, Measured. If you cite a
  measurement from the book, cite this repository for the code and captured
  output that produced it.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Danny B."
    family-names: Carr
    name-suffix: Jr.
    affiliation: "Carr Digital LLC"
repository-code: "https://github.com/DannyBCarrJr/post-quantum-measured-lab"
url: "https://leanpub.com/post-quantum-measured"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21750546
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.21750546
    description: >-
      Concept DOI. Always resolves to the latest version; cite this one unless
      you need to pin a specific release.
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.21750547
    description: Version DOI for v1.0.0.
abstract: >-
  Reproducible labs and captured output behind every claim the book
  Post-Quantum, Measured labels Verified: ML-KEM, ML-DSA and SLH-DSA
  performance, certificate sizes, TLS handshake behaviour, and hybrid key
  exchange, taken on stock OpenSSL 3.5 on a single laptop with no HSM, cloud
  account, or network access required.
keywords:
  - post-quantum cryptography
  - OpenSSL
  - ML-KEM
  - ML-DSA
  - SLH-DSA
  - TLS
  - benchmarks
